  message: "Fixed in 85ee2a03f7 (dev). _scan_file_for_jsx_usages returns (name, line). The edge's src is the innermost function/method/class whose span holds the usage, else the file node; the edge line is the usage line. No fabricated id, and no hardcoded typescript: the src comes from a real node, so it has that node's language. Live repro on dev dcc7d14b61: App.jsx renders <Button /> inside function App (line 4) and at module level (line 6), with Button defined in Button.jsx; hypergumbo run, survey.json. Results: references line 4 javascript:App.jsx:3-5:App:function -> javascript:Button.jsx:2-2:Button:function; references line 6 javascript:App.jsx:1-1:file:file -> same dst. Both endpoints are nodes, and there are 0 jsx_usage ids."  # f325
